From 5d36506e35dc8231feb4aedde9581b097090c8ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rjoande <pietroaliprandi@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:19:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Other mods' resources read from a list:
 PluginData/resources.cfg says what each of the Community Resource Pack's
 resources counts as (fuel, oxidiser, solid, monopropellant, gas, vapour, ore,
 charge, hydrogen, or nothing), and for how much of its weight against the
 stock one (hydrogen nearly three times kerosene, methanol half), looked up by
 name before the guesses by name, which stay for anything not listed; a
 VOLUMETRIC_EXPLOSIONS_RESOURCES node among the game's configs can add to it
 or override it, as RealBattery.cfg does for that mod's batteries (a unit of
 theirs is 3600 of the game's)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md                                |   4 +
 build.sh                                 |   8 +-
 src/VolumetricExplosions/Addon.cs        |   1 +
 src/VolumetricExplosions/RealBattery.cfg |  14 ++
 src/VolumetricExplosions/Records.cs      |   3 +-
 src/VolumetricExplosions/Resources.cs    | 112 ++++++++++++
 src/VolumetricExplosions/resources.cfg   | 216 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 355 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/VolumetricExplosions/RealBattery.cfg
 create mode 100644 src/VolumetricExplosions/Resources.cs
 create mode 100644 src/VolumetricExplosions/resources.cfg

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index e30eef4..fa41bf4 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -18,6 +18,10 @@ For Kerbal Space Program 1.12.x. It needs no other mod.
 * **Smoke that behaves like smoke:** it rises and rolls, drifts on the wind, lies on the ground, goes round buildings
   and is pushed about by craft.
 * **Shock fronts, pieces and burn marks,** shadows under the smoke, and fires that burn on where fuel was spilt.
+* **Other mods' resources** count as the stock ones they are like, and for what each is worth beside it: liquid
+  hydrogen as fuel (with a clear flame, and nearly three times kerosene's fire for its weight), liquid oxygen as
+  oxidiser, argon as xenon, and so on. `PluginData/resources.cfg` lists every resource of the Community Resource
+  Pack; one not listed is guessed at by its name. With RealBattery, a battery's charge counts for all it holds.
 * **Engines' flames and smoke,** with [Engine Flames](https://github.com/IshiakiZ/ksp-engine-flames) and
   [Rocket Smoke](https://github.com/IshiakiZ/ksp-rocket-smoke), which are made in the same air.
 
diff --git a/build.sh b/build.sh
index dd98440..15ec5d4 100755
--- a/build.sh
+++ b/build.sh
@@ -27,8 +27,12 @@ build() {
   cp "$SRC"/Textures/*.png "$SRC"/Textures/*.bin "$SRC"/Shaders/*.bundle "$OUT/PluginData/"
